ReceiptPrinterPlayground
https://github.com/at-point-of-sale/ReceiptPrinterPlayground

The checkout of the playground carries no licence file and its package.json is
private without a licence field, so there was nothing to copy here. It is the
repository of the author of this package, and the sample scripts of
src/assets/templates are the features of ReceiptPrinterEncoder written down, so the
streams in this directory are recorded under the MIT licence this ecosystem is
published under. When the playground gets a licence file of its own, the capture
script copies it over this file.

